<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Again - Sped Up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Noah Cyrus</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Again (Sped Up)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0rOr9keQo3p8glKPhafY9J</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.590" end="00:10.930">You just made the worst mistake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.930" end="00:14.500">And you'll regret it, darlin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.500" end="00:18.460">'Cause once you give and then you take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.460" end="00:22.490">You'll only end up wanting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.490" end="00:27.910">(Ooh-ooh-ooh) was everything hard enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.910" end="00:29.970" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.970" end="00:36.000">(Ooh-ooh-ooh) 'cause one day you'll wake up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.000" end="00:37.500">And then you'll say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.150" end="00:40.600">"I wanna be your lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.600" end="00:43.910">I don't wanna be your friend"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.910" end="00:47.890">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.890" end="00:51.610">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.610" end="00:55.620">I-I wanna be your lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.620" end="00:59.000">Baby, I'll hold my breath</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.000" end="01:02.830">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.830" end="01:06.550">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.550" end="01:09.700">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.700" end="01:14.020">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.020" end="01:17.430">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.430" end="01:21.860">So tell me that you love me again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.860" end="01:25.520">I said that I'd be fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.520" end="01:29.660">But I'm not this designed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.660" end="01:32.600">To be in the world without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.600" end="01:36.090">You act like you don't mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.090" end="01:39.760">So talk to me, honey, I'm missin' your sweet voice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.760" end="01:43.580">Like runnin' out of money, I guess I got no choice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.580" end="01:47.590">I said I didn't need you and now I'm in this bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.590" end="01:50.750">Even though the words I said (hey!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.750" end="01:54.840">Saying, "I wanna be your lover"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.840" end="01:58.340">"I don't wanna be your friend"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.340" end="02:01.940">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.940" end="02:05.540">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.540" end="02:09.190">I-I wanna be your lover</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.190" end="02:13.140">You're leavin' when the clock hits ten</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.140" end="02:16.910">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.910" end="02:20.380">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.380" end="02:24.020">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.020" end="02:27.630">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.630" end="02:31.640">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone, my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.640" end="02:35.470">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.470" end="02:38.870">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.870" end="02:42.890">Again, babe, again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.890" end="02:46.480">You don't know what you got 'til it's gone my dear</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.480" end="02:54.480">So tell me that you love me again (tell me that you love me again...)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.750" end="02:59.750" /></div></body></tt>